        "original_id": "0b9bb89d-4544-5587-9e53-a2bc18217308",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: French Bulldog, American Bulldog\n- People: Brigitte\n- Places: England, Paris, France\n- Concepts: dog breeds, breed types, crossbreeding, dog acting roles\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1800s, the French Bulldog resulted from a cross between bulldog ancestors imported from England and local ratters in Paris, France.\n- Brigitte was born in 2010.\n- The French Bulldog, also known as the Frenchie, is a small breed of domestic dog.\n- The American Bulldog is a breed of utility dog.\n- The American Bulldog has two specific types, Standard and Classic, and also includes mixes of those two types.\n- Brigitte is a French Bulldog dog actress best known for playing Stella in the ABC television series \"Modern Family\".",
